; The Arnold C functions Sisir for 3ds Max calls (common/ArnoldCurves.h), for an import library that
; needs no Arnold install to build. ai.dll is delay-loaded: these resolve only inside MAXtoA's
; translation, from the ai.dll MAXtoA has already loaded. All exist since Arnold 7.0.
LIBRARY ai.dll
EXPORTS
    AiArray
    AiArrayAllocate
    AiArrayMap
    AiArrayUnmap
    AiNodeDeclare
    AiNodeLookUpUserParameter
    AiNodeSetArray
    AiNodeSetStr
    AiCreateAtStringData_private
    AiAtStringLength
    AiAtStringHash
